# Docker build context exclusions for Dockerfile.api.
#
# Keep this lean — every entry shaves build time AND prevents secrets
# from leaking into image layers.

# ── Repo plumbing ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.dockerignore
Dockerfile*

# ── Editor / OS junk ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Python build / cache ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
*.egg-info
build
dist

# ── Secrets / local config ───────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
service-account*.json

# ── Logs and run artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
phoenix-server.log
scripts/_repro.log
_run_*.py
_run_*.out
_run_*.stderr

# ── Local Phoenix + memory state ──────────────────────────────────────
# Phoenix state stays local. Memory state too — EXCEPT the demo seed
# JSONLs which ship in the image so /prompts /sentinel-health /evals
# and the briefing's similar-incidents recall render with grounded
# data on every fresh container start (Cloud Run is stateless). The
# scripts/bake_demo_seed.py regenerates these deterministically.
.phoenix
data/memory/*
!data/memory/prompt_history.jsonl
!data/memory/incidents.jsonl

# ── Frontend (built separately via web/Dockerfile) ───────────────────
web

# ── Tests / docs (not needed at runtime) ─────────────────────────────
tests
docs
context
.claude
CLAUDE.md
docs/superpowers
README.md
